  '{2}',
  'Option C (To create customized views of metrics and alarms) is the primary benefit of Amazon CloudWatch Dashboards. Dashboards allow you to monitor your resources in a single view, even across different Regions, by creating custom visualizations of your metrics and alarms. Option A (To automatically remediate resource configuration drift) is a function of AWS Config. Option B (To capture and store API call history) is provided by AWS CloudTrail. Option D (To analyze network traffic patterns in real-time) can be done with VPC Flow Logs integrated with other analysis tools, but Dashboards provide visualization, not raw analysis.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain50_11',
  NOW(),
  6,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_50_4',
  'easy'
