  '{0,2}',
  'Option A (VPC Flow Logs) records metadata about IP traffic flowing through network interfaces in a VPC, providing visibility into network traffic patterns. Option C (Traffic Mirroring) allows you to copy network traffic from an Elastic Network Interface (ENI) of an Amazon EC2 instance and forward it to a monitoring appliance for deep packet inspection. Option B (AWS CloudTrail) records API calls and related events, not network traffic content. Option D (Amazon GuardDuty) is a threat detection service that monitors for malicious activity and unauthorized behavior, but it doesn''t capture raw traffic logs. Option E (AWS Network Firewall) is a managed firewall service, not a traffic capture or logging service.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain50_11',
  NOW(),
  5,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_50_4',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO public.question (id, text, type, options, correct_answer, explanation, created_at, quiz_id, modified_at, index, pairs, matches, module_id, difficulty)
VALUES (
  'q_50_m_50_4_26',
  'A company requires a solution to centralize the monitoring of application metrics and logs from various AWS services, and also to set up automated alerts for operational issues. Which AWS services are best suited for these tasks? (Select TWO.)',
  'multiple',
  '["Amazon CloudWatch","AWS Lambda","Amazon SNS","AWS Step Functions","Amazon S3"]'::json,
  '{0,2}',
  'Option A (Amazon CloudWatch) is the primary service for collecting and tracking metrics, collecting and monitoring log files, and setting alarms for AWS resources and applications. Option C (Amazon SNS) is a highly available, durable, secure, fully managed pub/sub messaging service that can be used to send notifications (e.g., email, SMS) when CloudWatch alarms are triggered. Option B (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service, which can be invoked by CloudWatch events but is not primarily for monitoring or alerting itself. Option D (AWS Step Functions) is a serverless workflow service. Option E (Amazon S3) is object storage, not a monitoring or alerting service.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain50_11',
  NOW(),
  6,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_50_4',
  'medium'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO public.question (id, text, type, options, correct_answer, explanation, created_at, quiz_id, modified_at, index, pairs, matches, module_id, difficulty)
