  'Option A (AWS Transit Gateway Network Manager) provides a single global view of your private network across AWS and on-premises, allowing you to monitor network performance and events. Option C (AWS Reachability Analyzer) is a network diagnostics tool that troubleshoots network connectivity between two endpoints in your VPCs. Option B (AWS Direct Connect) and Option E (AWS VPN) are services for establishing network connectivity, not for analyzing reachability. Option D (Amazon Route 53) is a DNS web service, not a network path analysis tool.',
