  'multiple',
  '["AWS Site-to-Site VPN","AWS Client VPN","AWS Direct Connect","Amazon CloudFront","AWS Global Accelerator"]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'AWS Site-to-Site VPN (Option A) creates an encrypted tunnel between your on-premises network and your Amazon VPC over the public internet. AWS Client VPN (Option B) allows individual users to securely access AWS resources and on-premises networks from any location using a VPN client. AWS Direct Connect (Option C) provides a dedicated private connection, not over the public internet. Amazon CloudFront (Option D) is a content delivery network. AWS Global Accelerator (Option E) improves performance for global users but doesn''t extend your on-premises network.',
