  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) states that a Virtual Private Gateway (VPG) is used to connect an Amazon VPC to an on-premises network via an AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection or an AWS Direct Connect connection. This is its primary purpose. Option B describes a NAT Gateway or Internet Gateway. Option C describes VPC peering or AWS Transit Gateway. Option D describes an AWS Transit Gateway.',
