  'To create a new CloudWatch dashboard, you first navigate to the CloudWatch console and select the ''Dashboards'' section (Option C). From there, you choose the option to create a new dashboard (Option D). You then provide a unique name for your new dashboard (Option B). Once the dashboard is named, you can begin adding various widgets to display metrics, logs, or alarms (Option A).',
