  '["Define the filter pattern to match specific log events.","Select the desired CloudWatch Logs group.","Assign a metric name, namespace, and value to the filtered data.","Choose ''Create metric filter'' from the Actions menu."]'::json,
  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To create a metric filter, you first select the existing CloudWatch Logs group that contains the logs you want to filter (Option B). Then, from the Actions menu, you choose ''Create metric filter'' (Option D). Next, you define the filter pattern that CloudWatch Logs will use to match specific log events (Option A). Finally, you assign a metric name, namespace, and a metric value to the data extracted by the filter, making it available for graphing and alarming (Option C).',
