  NULL,
  'Baseline performance (left[0]) refers to establishing the normal operating characteristics of a system, which helps in identifying deviations or anomalies. Custom Metrics (left[1]) are user-defined metrics that allow you to publish specific application or service data to CloudWatch beyond the default metrics provided by AWS services. Log Groups (left[2]) act as containers for log streams in Amazon CloudWatch Logs, enabling logical organization and retention policy management for logs.',
