  'matching',
  '{"A":"Amazon CloudWatch","B":"VPC Flow Logs","C":"AWS CloudTrail","D":"Traffic Mirroring"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'Amazon CloudWatch (left item 0) is a monitoring and observability service that provides data and actionable insights for AWS, hybrid, and on-premises applications and resources. VPC Flow Logs (left item 1) capture information about the IP traffic going to and from network interfaces in a VPC. AWS CloudTrail (left item 2) records API calls made within an AWS account, providing an audit trail. Traffic Mirroring (left item 3) allows you to copy network traffic from an Elastic Network Interface (ENI) and send it to a destination for deep packet inspection.',
