  NULL,
  'Reachability Analyzer (left item 0) is a network diagnostics tool that troubleshoots reachability between two resources in your VPCs. Transit Gateway Network Manager (left item 1) provides a single pane of glass to manage your global network across AWS Regions and on-premises. CloudWatch Logs Insights (left item 2) enables you to interactively search and analyze your log data in Amazon CloudWatch Logs. CloudWatch Alarms (left item 3) watch a single metric or the result of a metric math expression and perform one or more actions based on the value of the metric relative to a threshold over a number of time periods.',
