VALUES (
  'q_51_m_51_4_58',
  'A security team needs to enforce strict network access controls and regularly audit configurations across all VPCs. They want to automate the deployment of standardized Network ACLs and Security Groups, ensuring that any deviations are detected and remediated automatically. The solution should integrate with existing security tooling and provide detailed logs for compliance. Match the AWS service to its role in an automated security enforcement pipeline.',
  'matching',
  '{"A":"AWS Config","B":"AWS Lambda","C":"Amazon EventBridge"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'AWS Config (left[0]) provides resource compliance monitoring (right[2]) by continuously recording and evaluating AWS resource configurations against desired rules. AWS Lambda (left[1]) can be triggered by AWS Config or EventBridge to execute serverless remediation functions (right[0]), automatically correcting non-compliant resources. Amazon EventBridge (left[2]) acts as a serverless event bus that enables rule-based event routing (right[1]) from various AWS services, custom applications, and SaaS applications, allowing for flexible automation workflows.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain51_11',
  NOW(),
  16,
  '{"left":["AWS Config","AWS Lambda","Amazon EventBridge"],"right":["Serverless remediation functions","Rule-based event routing","Resource compliance monitoring"]}'::json,
  '{"left":[0,1,2],"right":[0,1,2]}'::jsonb,
  'm_51_4',
  'hard'
