  'matching',
  '{"A":"A record","B":"CNAME record","C":"MX record"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'An A record (left item 0) in Amazon Route 53 is used to map a domain name to an IPv4 address. A CNAME record (left item 1) maps an alias domain name to another canonical domain name. An MX record (left item 2) specifies the mail servers responsible for receiving email messages on behalf of a domain name.',
