VALUES (
  'q_51_m_51_1_49',
  'Match the AWS Site-to-Site VPN component to its function.',
  'matching',
  '{"A":"VPN Connection","B":"Customer Gateway","C":"Virtual Private Gateway"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'A VPN Connection (left item 0) refers to the encrypted tunnel established between your on-premises network and your AWS VPC. A Customer Gateway (left item 1) is a resource in AWS that represents your physical or software VPN device on your on-premises network. A Virtual Private Gateway (left item 2) is the AWS side of a VPN connection, acting as the VPN concentrator for your VPC.',
