  '["An Internet Gateway attached to the database subnet.","A public subnet for the database instances.","A private subnet with no direct route to an Internet Gateway.","An Elastic IP address associated with the database instance."]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (A private subnet with no direct route to an Internet Gateway) is the correct approach. Placing database instances in a private subnet ensures they are not directly accessible from the internet, enhancing security. Option A (Internet Gateway) provides internet access, which is contrary to the goal of isolation. Option B (A public subnet) also provides direct internet access. Option D (An Elastic IP address) provides a public IP address, making the instance internet-accessible.',
