  '["Amazon CloudWatch","Amazon VPC Flow Logs","AWS CloudTrail","AWS Config"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS CloudTrail) is the correct service. It provides a record of actions taken by a user, role, or an AWS service in your AWS account, recording API calls and delivering log files to an Amazon S3 bucket. Option A (Amazon CloudWatch) collects monitoring and operational data in the form of logs, metrics, and events. Option B (Amazon VPC Flow Logs) captures information about the IP traffic going to and from network interfaces in your VPC. Option D (AWS Config) continuously monitors and records your AWS resource configurations.',
