VALUES (
  'q_52_m_52_1_111',
  'A large enterprise is extending its on-premises network to AWS using AWS Direct Connect. They need to ensure efficient and resilient routing between their data centers and multiple VPCs across different AWS Regions. The network team is evaluating various AWS networking components to manage complex routing policies and ensure high availability.',
