  'Amazon VPC Flow Logs capture information about the IP traffic going to and from network interfaces in your VPC. AWS CloudWatch collects monitoring and operational data in the form of logs, metrics, and events, providing a unified view of AWS resources. Amazon CloudWatch Logs is a service that allows you to centralize the logs from all of your systems, applications, and AWS services that you use, for monitoring and analysis.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain52_11',
  NOW(),
  20,
  '{"left":["Amazon VPC Flow Logs","AWS CloudWatch","Amazon CloudWatch Logs"],"right":["Captures IP traffic records","Collects metrics and logs","Stores and monitors log data"]}'::json,
