  '{"A":"AWS Config","B":"AWS Systems Manager","C":"AWS CloudFormation"}'::json,
  NULL,
  'AWS Config assesses, audits, and evaluates the configurations of your AWS resources, helping to verify that network configurations align with your intended state. AWS Systems Manager provides a unified interface to view operational data from multiple AWS services and automate operational tasks across your AWS resources, which can include network-related automation. AWS CloudFormation allows you to model, provision, and manage AWS and third-party resources as infrastructure as code, ensuring consistent and verifiable network deployments.',
