  '{2,0,3,1}',
  'To provision and deploy an ACM certificate, the first step is to request the certificate (Option C). Once requested, you must validate domain ownership (Option A) to prove you control the domain. After validation, the certificate is issued. Next, you need an HTTPS listener on your Application Load Balancer (Option D) to handle encrypted traffic. Finally, you associate the issued certificate with this HTTPS listener (Option B) to enable TLS termination.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain53_11',
  NOW(),
  1,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_53_3',
  'easy'
