  '["Request a new certificate for the same domain in ACM.","Wait for the new certificate to be issued and validated by ACM.","Update the ALB listener to use the newly issued certificate.","Monitor the ALB and application for successful traffic flow with the new certificate."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To rotate an ACM certificate with minimal downtime, the first step is to request a new certificate for the same domain within ACM (Option A). This allows the old certificate to remain active while the new one is being processed. Next, you must wait for ACM to successfully issue and validate the new certificate (Option B). Once issued, the ALB listener can be updated to use this new certificate (Option C). Finally, it''s crucial to monitor the ALB and the application to ensure traffic is flowing correctly and securely with the newly deployed certificate (Option D).',
